        "height": 960
      },
      "geometry": {
        "x": 377.59375,
        "y": 38.390625,
        "width": 684.8125,
        "height": 196.234375
      },
      "scrollStep": 0,
      "offsets": [],
      "nonWhitePixels": 12361,
      "renderedText": "1102.\n去程所需时间较长。设距离为 \n𝐷\n>\n0\nD>0，两种不同的正速度为 \n𝑣\n1\n,\n𝑣\n2\nv\n1\n\t​\n\n,v\n2\n\t​\n\n。去程按距离各分一半，用时 \n𝑇\n1\n=\n𝐷\n/\n(\n2\n𝑣\n1\n)\n+\n𝐷\n/\n(\n2\n𝑣\n2\n)\n=\n𝐷\n(\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝑣\n2\n)\n/\n(\n2\n𝑣\n1\n𝑣\n2\n)\nT\n1\n\t​\n\n=D/(2v\n1\n\t​\n\n)+D/(2v\n2\n\t​\n\n)=D(v\n1\n\t​\n\n+v\n2\n\t​\n\n)/(2v\n1\n\t​\n\nv\n2\n\t​\n\n)；回程按时间各分一半，由 \n𝐷\n=\n𝑇\n2\n(\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝑣\n2\n)\n/\n2\nD=T\n2\n\t​\n\n(v\n1\n\t​\n\n+v\n2\n\t​\n\n)/2 得 \n𝑇\n2\n=\n2\n𝐷\n/\n(\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝑣\n2\n)\nT\n2\n\t​\n\n=2D/(v\n1\n\t​\n\n+v\n2\n\t​\n\n)。所以 \n𝑇\n1\n−\n𝑇\n2\n=\n𝐷\n(\n𝑣\n1\n−\n𝑣\n2\n)\n2\n/\n[\n2\n𝑣\n1\n𝑣\n2\n(\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝑣\n2\n)\n]\n>\n0\nT\n1\n\t​\n\n−T\n2\n\t​\n\n=D(v\n1\n\t​\n\n−v\n2\n\t​\n\n)\n2\n/[2v\n1\n\t​\n\nv\n2\n\t​\n\n(v\n1\n\t​\n\n+v\n2\n\t​\n\n)]>0。速度不同的原条件使不等式严格成立。",
      "status": "RUNTIME_PASS_VISUAL_PENDING"
    },
