      "scrollStep": 0,
      "offsets": [],
      "nonWhitePixels": 11132,
      "renderedText": "1099.\n较迟到达者走完全程需 \n5\n5 小时，另一人需 \n10\n/\n3\n10/3 小时，即 \n3\n3 小时 \n20\n20 分。设两者全程用时为 \n𝑇\n1\n>\n𝑇\n2\n>\n0\nT\n1\n\t​\n\n>T\n2\n\t​\n\n>0，则 \n𝑇\n1\n−\n𝑇\n2\n=\n5\n/\n3\nT\n1\n\t​\n\n−T\n2\n\t​\n\n=5/3，且同时出发、两小时相遇给出 \n1\n/\n𝑇\n1\n+\n1\n/\n𝑇\n2\n=\n1\n/\n2\n1/T\n1\n\t​\n\n+1/T\n2\n\t​\n\n=1/2。令 \n𝑇\n2\n=\n𝑠\nT\n2\n\t​\n\n=s 得 \n3\n𝑠\n2\n−\n7\n𝑠\n−\n10\n=\n0\n3s\n2\n−7s−10=0，取正根 \n𝑠\n=\n10\n/\n3\ns=10/3，所以 \n𝑇\n1\n=\n5\nT\n1\n\t​\n\n=5。",
      "status": "RUNTIME_PASS_VISUAL_PENDING"
    },
    {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3129/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-3129/hard-answer-display-FIRST/390-ex-1100-scroll0.png",
      "bytes": 49844,
      "sha256": "1cca130f5735b85bdc78f18f6a58a01009df9fdd3f319ee65a5911f412a3cd75",
      "exercise": "1100",
      "viewport": {
